---
 tools/ceowills/HISTORY.md              |   2 ++
 tools/ceowills/assets/adnan-avatar.png | Bin 0 -> 180530 bytes
 tools/ceowills/cta_history.json        |   6 ++--
 tools/ceowills/layout.json             |   2 ++
 tools/ceowills/render.py               |   6 +++-
 tools/ceowills/tracker.json            |  42 ++++++++++++-------------
 6 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/ceowills/assets/adnan-avatar.png

diff --git a/tools/ceowills/HISTORY.md b/tools/ceowills/HISTORY.md
index 0bc3c00..7aee7a0 100644
--- a/tools/ceowills/HISTORY.md
+++ b/tools/ceowills/HISTORY.md
@@ -335,3 +335,5 @@ talking about; it helps choose the right CTA. Good CTAs help make more money for
   New per-job `tone` (render.py `tone_vf`: exposure in EV, then a shoulder from `knee` that lands full white on `white`,
   slope 1 at the knee so the mid tones don't move): #14 gets −0.1 EV, knee 0.65, white 0.9 → face p95 ≈ 218, no
   clipping, mid tones −5 %.
+- **Eyad, 2 Oct: "use this icon"** (SK Media chat, Adnan's black-and-white headshot) → the iMessage card's contact photo is
+  `assets/adnan-avatar.png` (layout.json `notify.avatar`) in every video, instead of a frame cut from that video.
diff --git a/tools/ceowills/assets/adnan-avatar.png b/tools/ceowills/assets/adnan-avatar.png
